; PLAY - rows 0-11: first-person view in the BG (double buffer $9800/$9C00, map rows 8-19,
; SCY base 64). The view here is a PLACEHOLDER drawn with automap tiles (real pieces: walls.tiles
; + view.pcs, pixel-artist). Monster/item sprites go over it (gdd 2.3), never below line 96.
; Rows 12-17: HUD in the WINDOW (WY=96, WX=7, $9C00 rows 0-5): window row = screen row - 12,
; window offset = SCREEN_PLAY_AT_x - 12 * 32. Not moved by SCX/SCY (bob, slide, shake).
;   row 12 (w0) status: heart col 1, HP "18/20" (2 digits, leading blank) cols 2-6, weapon
;     icon col 8 (ICON_DAGGER / ICON_STAFF), amulet col 9 (ICON_AMULET or BLANK), key icon
;     col 11 + count col 12, potion icon col 14 + count col 15, compass col 17 + letter col 18.
;   row 13 (w1) blank on purpose: no separator line (user preference).
;   rows 14-17 (w2-w5): message log, 4 lines x 18 chars at cols 1-18, newest at the bottom.
; '/' is DASH until the font has SLASH (gdd E14): then change the legend line to '/ SLASH'.
tilesets: ui font
legend:
w AM_WALL
u AM_UP
, AM_FLOOR
& ICON_HP
^ ICON_STAFF
$ ICON_AMULET
[ ICON_KEY
] ICON_POTION
@ ICON_COMPASS
/ DASH
: COLON
